<i>Oh, baby</i>

542
01:02:37.688 --> 01:02:41.659
<i>Hooked on this thing called love</i>

543
01:02:42.693 --> 01:02:46.664
<i>Hooked on this thing called love</i>

544
01:02:46.822 --> 01:02:48.665
<i>Somebody tell me</i>

545
01:02:49.366 --> 01:02:50.913
<i>What does this man got</i>

546
01:02:51.368 --> 01:02:53.416
<i>He makes me cry</i>

547
