554
01:03:12.639 --> 01:03:16.689
<i>Trapped by this thing
they call love</i>

555
01:03:17.352 --> 01:03:18.979
<i>Oh, baby</i>

556
01:03:19.938 --> 01:03:21.235
<i>I'm trapped</i>

557
01:03:22.608 --> 01:03:24.576
<i>I can't help myself</i>

558
01:03:25.068 --> 01:03:27.196
<i>I'm hooked on you baby</i>

559
01:03:27.654 --> 01:03:29.281
<i>I just can't help it</i>

560
01:03:30.073 --> 01:03:34.920
<i>I can never be happy
Loving no one else</i>

561
01:03:35.245 --> 01:03:39.000
<i>Oh, baby
I love you</i>

562
