860
01:32:38.362 --> 01:32:40.660
Yes, well, be grateful
it's not the police.

861
01:32:42.950 --> 01:32:45.169
Yes, I'm still here.

862
01:32:46.119 --> 01:32:48.087
Thank you. Yes.

863
01:32:48.288 --> 01:32:52.464
Two tickets, first class, leaving
