914
01:41:35.315 --> 01:41:37.818
My old darling.

915
01:41:44.073 --> 01:41:46.747
Oh, yeah.

916
01:41:48.203 --> 01:41:51.002
What a piece of work is a man.

917
01:41:52.081 --> 01:41:54.925
What is this quintessence of dust?

918
