I shall be.

944
01:46:01.706 --> 01:46:04.004
Oh, Eve.

945
01:46:50.129 --> 01:46:52.757
Oh, look at that shit.

946
01:47:04.685 --> 01:47:07.029
- What are we gonna do?
- What are we gonna do?

947
01:47:16.948 --> 01:47:19.417
Well, I know what I'm gonna do.

948
01:47:23.704 --> 01:47:26.253
